1294051438960511", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619751_1294051442293844_8154713239817790874_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EjoS67NuWu4Q7kNvwFOT5sR&_nc_oc=AdrKxDPxG0Uw_lFTus-Q7oaFNqU288r1-qrguLc7UN9qN6zhbhZ2HQuODkP-Kqf7Kgs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSjULUJqRj0ZVVAmQLF1IQ7Lup4D9Z7oEQ_YqSuIbh7iA&oe=6B01D12D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image Trailer.png", "id": "965261262669942", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_965261266003275_4119045274853098971_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6BtYy-dW97YQ7kNvwEddjgE&_nc_oc=AdpQqa706h3U_mDK1sC_SWxZv5EGVsjn7B7GZMDibe3xg-UhWc1FSx3DIiCJomgdYsI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSamq8N0sK11CZqZWmMdJnyQJ0qKvSyL7Wl0DQO6re_zg&oe=6B01C645"}, "display_name": "A Trav\u00e9s del Iris", "keywords": ["Narrativa", "Exploraci\u00f3n", "Memoria", "Aventura", "Personal"], "long_description": "Revive tus recuerdos y descubre que cambi\u00f3 en ti.\n\nA trav\u00e9s del Iris es una experiencia narrativa que explora la memoria, la identidad y la introspecci\u00f3n emocional a trav\u00e9s del color, la narraci\u00f3n ambiental y la interacci\u00f3n.\n\nEn un espacio personal e \u00edntimo, los jugadores descubren fragmentos de la historia al interactuar con objetos cotidianos, sutiles pistas visuales y atm\u00f3sferas cambiantes. En lugar de basarse en una acci\u00f3n trepidante, la experiencia invita al descubrimiento pausado, la observaci\u00f3n y la interpretaci\u00f3n. El entorno evoluciona con cada interacci\u00f3n, transformando la forma en que el jugador percibe el espacio.\n\nCerrar los ojos con \"Blink-to-Think\" desencadena momentos de reflexi\u00f3n y sutiles transiciones narrativas, haciendo que la quietud forme parte de la progresi\u00f3n. \n\nUn juego de Sebastian Carrasco.", "short_description": "Una experiencia narrativa en VR donde la memoria, la identidad y el color construyen un viaje \u00edntimo de reflexi\u00f3n, interacci\u00f3n y descubrimiento emocional."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Game Icon.png", "id": "1607505360556230", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673625994_1607505367222896_1574350596834126161_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qs1B0wo82JoQ7kNvwHrDhX8&_nc_oc=Ado5cs0FfrHWo_E863fdtcekKIZ6TgfcVt8pa9srTr_VdiISE93D2hy8Wt6mjatVQkk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTIcqCq_Tq_dbyi0u6OblqH92PRdSGJMir4yRxr7b3WCw&oe=6B01DBDA"}, {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "1459118102347778", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618512_1459118105681111_1176602155369088893_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xscyY4Blj-IQ7kNvwFkKjty&_nc_oc=AdrtInfXGVlqo5qnrzELKcqe3s0-3iSN6p9sykjbDXBPLSweUuTsgwFATqp-SH8xM2Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSwmI7JozVvbhITF6kQLol-zKLFBHJw2PjEqJZbfqCnyA&oe=6B01EE2F"}, {"file_name": "Hero Cover.png", "id": "1327050222649759", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298137_1327050225983092_2181195551602462942_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Uc0_RoxrY74Q7kNvwHf8zu8&_nc_oc=Adr84xs_H_VmpH3FgYzOQ4dsJSaddXUnnSIrgJsAglifmU3CmO9uNhTmjTZTTAXAfUo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRLwcbEE2im7rLXiXqN8SMu_aALK-jOEG_M3xuxiBTsgw&oe=6B01C71D"}, {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "973518925187618", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_973518928520951_3852690785809695379_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gXTw